{"publicId":"8531ebf3-1a55-47de-a712-2f4bfcd13993","title":"GitHub-Stats-Extended 官方 Docker 镜像发布支持多架构部署","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-04T20:40:44.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-04T20:40:44.000Z","digest":"GitHub-Stats-Extended 维护者发布官方 Docker 镜像，支持 amd64 和 arm64 多架构部署，提供环境变量配置白名单用户、可选 Postgres 数据库存储卡片、设置缓存时长等功能（Reddit r/selfhosted 2026-11-05 报道）\n\n该镜像旨在解决传统部署中架构兼容性和配置集中化的痛点，开发者可通过指定环境变量快速适配不同安全策略和存储需求。目前镜像已托管至 GitHub 官方仓库，但尚未提供详细的性能测试数据或兼容性清单（根据同一来源的后续更新）\n\n与早期版本相比，此版本首次将 Docker 镜像作为官方部署方案，取代了旧版中依赖第三方容器工具的配置方式（Reddit r/selfhosted 2026-11-05 报道）","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-05T01:50:25.407Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"GitHub-Stats-Extended 维护者发布 Docker 镜像，支持多架构部署","latestReport":{"id":"x0wtit86ciuv5obpcsd5kmycm"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fk-l_EGS5C0I","title":"GitHub-Stats-Extended 发布官方 Docker 镜像","firstReportAt":"2026-11-04T20:40:44.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"x0wtit86ciuv5obpcsd5kmycm","title":"GitHub-Stats-Extended 维护者发布 Docker 镜像，支持多架构部署","summary":"GitHub-Stats-Extended 维护者发布 Docker 镜像，支持多架构部署（amd64/arm64），提供环境变量配置白名单用户、可选 Postgres 数据库存储卡片、设置缓存时长等功能。","source":{"name":"Reddit r/selfhosted","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-04T20:40:44.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"x0wtit86ciuv5obpcsd5kmycm","title":"GitHub-Stats-Extended 维护者发布 Docker 镜像，支持多架构部署","summary":"GitHub-Stats-Extended 维护者发布 Docker 镜像，支持多架构部署（amd64/arm64），提供环境变量配置白名单用户、可选 Postgres 数据库存储卡片、设置缓存时长等功能。","source":{"name":"Reddit r/selfhosted","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-04T20:40:44.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-05T09:00:00.000Z","heat":7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T10:00:00.000Z","heat":6.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T11:00:00.000Z","heat":6.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T12:00:00.000Z","heat":6.4,"participants":1},